  "model": "gpt-4o",
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "system",
      "content": "You are a viral YouTube Shorts quiz creator AND infographic designer. Generate highly engaging, curiosity-driven quiz videos using clean, modern infographic-style visuals. Focus on bold typography, icons, structured layouts, and high readability. Design content to maximize retention and reveal the answer only in the final 2 seconds."
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Create a quiz-style short video with INFOGRAPHIC-STYLE visuals:\n\nTOPIC: {{ $json['Story Topic'] }}\n\nSPECS:\n- Language: {{ $json['Language'] }}\n- Scenes: {{ $json['Number of Scenes'] }}\n- Audience: {{ $json['Target Audience'] }}\n- Difficulty: {{ $json['Difficulty'] }}\n- Art style: Infographic, flat design, minimal, modern UI\n- Mood: {{ $json['Story Mood'] }}\n\nRULES:\n1. Exactly {{ $json['Number of Scenes'] }} scenes\n2. First scene MUST be a strong hook\n3. Middle scenes present the quiz question and options (A/B/C/D) in a structured infographic layout\n4. Use visual hierarchy: title (top), question (center), options (stacked or grid)\n5. Build suspense with countdown scenes showing BIG numbers in the center\n6. DO NOT reveal the answer until the FINAL scene\n7. Final scene must reveal the correct answer clearly using highlight, color contrast, icons, or checkmarks\n8. Keep text short, punchy (max 10–12 words per scene)\n9. Each imagePrompt MUST describe an infographic layout including:\n   - text placement (top/center/grid)\n   - icons or visual symbols\n   - color scheme\n   - typography (bold, modern, high contrast)\n   - spacing and clean UI design\n10. Image prompts must be in English\n11. Use flat design, vector icons, minimal clutter\n12. Ensure mobile-first vertical (9:16) layout\n13. Add loop potential (ending connects to beginning)\n\nINFOGRAPHIC IMAGE STYLE GUIDE:\n- Clean background (dark or light gradient)\n- Bold sans-serif fonts\n- High contrast colors (yellow, white, cyan, neon accents)\n- Simple icons (arrows, clocks, question marks, checkmarks)\n- Grid or card-based layout\n- Center-focused composition\n\nFORMAT:\n- Scene 1: Hook (attention-grabbing infographic)\n- Scene 2–(n-2): Question + options (infographic layout)\n- Scene (n-1): Countdown (3-2-1 style)\n- Scene n: Answer reveal (highlight correct option visually)\n\nEXAMPLE IMAGE PROMPT FORMAT:\n\"Modern infographic style, dark gradient background, bold sans-serif font, large centered text 'Your quiz text here', question at center, options in 2x2 grid below, icons next to each option, high contrast yellow and white text, clean spacing, flat vector design, mobile vertical 9:16, highly readable\""
    }
  ],
  "response_format": {
    "type": "json_schema",
    "json_schema": {
      "name": "quiz_short_video",
      "strict": true,
      "schema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "title": { "type": "string" },
          "titleEnglish": { "type": "string" },
          "description": { "type": "string" },
          "descriptionEnglish": { "type": "string" },
          "language": { "type": "string" },
          "targetAudience": { "type": "string" },
          "difficulty": { "type": "string" },
          "topic": { "type": "string" },
          "scenes": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "sceneNumber": { "type": "number" },
                "type": { "type": "string", "enum": ["hook", "question", "countdown", "reveal"] },
                "text": { "type": "string" },
                "textEnglish": { "type": "string" },
